sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Payer as "Customer / Agent"
    participant Pay as "Payment Service"
    participant Rules as "Fee and Limit Rules"
    participant Wallet as "Wallet"
    participant Biller as "Biller Adapter"
    participant Notify as "Notifications"
    participant Jobs as "Scheduler and Reconciliation"

    Note over Payer,Jobs: Every money movement is audited and every state change is saved in the payment history

    rect rgb(235, 245, 255)
        Note over Payer,Notify: PART 1 - Pay a bill
        Payer->>Pay: Pay (idempotencyKey, customerId, service, inputs, amount, agentId?)

        alt Key already used with the same details
            Pay-->>Payer: Return the original payment state (no second payment)
        else Key already used with different details
            Pay-->>Payer: Refused
        else New request
            Pay->>Pay: Check biller active and required fields
            Pay->>Rules: Calculate fee and agent commission
            Rules-->>Pay: fee, total, commission
            Pay->>Pay: Save key and create payment (Initiated)

            Pay->>Wallet: Lock wallet, then run limit checks and hold together
            Wallet->>Rules: Check blocked, 5 per 60s, 5 to 10000, daily limit
            alt Check fails or not enough funds
                Pay->>Pay: Initiated to Rejected
                Pay-->>Payer: Rejected with reason, balances unchanged
            else Funds held
                Pay->>Pay: Initiated to FundsHeld to SentToBiller
                Pay->>Biller: Send payment

                alt Confirmed (ElectroCo, AquaCo)
                    Biller-->>Pay: Confirmed
                    Pay->>Pay: Completed
                    Pay->>Wallet: Capture hold, credit fee, credit agent commission
                    Pay->>Notify: SMS and Push (3 retries)
                    Pay-->>Payer: Completed
                else Refused
                    Biller-->>Pay: Refused
                    Pay->>Pay: Failed
                    Pay->>Wallet: Release hold
                    Pay->>Pay: Refunded
                    Pay->>Notify: SMS with reason and Push
                    Pay-->>Payer: Failed and refunded
                else TopUpNet accepted
                    Biller-->>Pay: Accepted
                    Pay-->>Payer: Processing (stays SentToBiller)
                else No answer in 10 s
                    Biller-->>Pay: Timeout
                    Pay->>Pay: Unknown (money stays held)
                    Pay-->>Payer: Processing
                end
            end
        end
    end

    rect rgb(245, 245, 245)
        Note over Biller,Jobs: PART 2 - Later results
        Biller->>Pay: TopUpNet callback (success or failed)
        alt Payment is SentToBiller or Unknown
            Pay->>Pay: Success: Completed and pay out. Failed: Failed, release, Refunded
        else Already final
            Pay->>Pay: Same result: ignore and log. Different result: log and flag for support
        end

        Jobs->>Pay: No TopUpNet callback after 5 minutes
        Pay->>Pay: SentToBiller to Unknown

        loop 1, 5 and 15 minutes after Unknown (max 3)
            Jobs->>Biller: Ask biller for status
            alt Confirmed
                Pay->>Pay: Unknown to Completed and pay out
            else Refused
                Pay->>Pay: Unknown to Failed, release, Refunded
            else No clear answer
                Pay->>Pay: Stay Unknown, money stays held
            end
        end

        Jobs->>Jobs: Daily settlement file, match by payment reference
        alt Unknown and listed as received
            Jobs->>Pay: Complete it
        else Unknown and not listed
            Jobs->>Pay: Fail it and release hold
        else Failed or Refunded but listed as received
            Jobs->>Jobs: Flag for support, no state or balance change
        else Other difference
            Jobs->>Jobs: List in report
        end
    end
